      "cooked": "<p>They no longer do codes, as Apple has declared codes a blasphemy to the Laws of the App Store. It has been replaced with an ‘Unlock’ button.</p>\n<p>Handelabra puts it more succinctly in this blog post:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/55b0b77e72f79c1a6bac42d78dec13d825ebe409.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2015/10/21/ios-multiplayer-status-rejection-and-steps-forward\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Handelabra Games</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:647/500;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/40faad8b6e3816db56c2c7a8d8224ce9c868ecf5_2_647x500.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"647\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/40faad8b6e3816db56c2c7a8d8224ce9c868ecf5_2_647x500.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/40faad8b6e3816db56c2c7a8d8224ce9c868ecf5_2_970x750.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/40faad8b6e3816db56c2c7a8d8224ce9c868ecf5_2_1294x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/4/40faad8b6e3816db56c2c7a8d8224ce9c868ecf5_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2015/10/21/ios-multiplayer-status-rejection-and-steps-forward\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">iOS Multiplayer Status - Rejection and Steps Forward — Handelabra Games</a></h3>\n\n<p>Unfortunately, there is one major group of Sentinels fans that are not currently enjoying multiplayer - iPad users. And the reason just might surprise you!</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
